  "narrative": {
    "overview": "The calculator uses a calm loan form with small field groups and local help.\nSimple and Advanced share the same type, controls, colors, and values.\nThis records the existing app. It does not set a new brand theme.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Neutral light and dark surfaces.",
